hup", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a tomato sauce", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need ketchup for my sandwich.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Miss", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a young woman", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(title)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Excuse me Miss, can you help me?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read the roles below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, choose one of the roles. Your partner will play the other role.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Have a conversation with your partner. Complete the steps in your role.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the modal <span class=\"italic\">can</span> and the verbs <span class=\"italic\">hand me</span> and <span class=\"italic\">pass</span> in your conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1: Customer</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Request a table.<br/>Place an order.  <br/>Ask the waiter to hand you something. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2: Waiter</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Seat the customer. <br/>Take the order. <br/>Hand something to the customer. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use the modal <span class=\"italic\">can</span> to make a polite request. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use <span class=\"italic\">hand me</span> and <span class=\"italic\">pass</span> to ask my partner to pass something. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}